                <head>297. Telegram 931 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d297-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-10-19">October 19, 1955, 4:09
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d297-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d297-1"/>
                <p>931. For Johnson. Deptel 914.</p>
                <p>Second sentence para 5 should follow first sentence para 4.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
